WEBVTT

00:03:26.916 --> 00:03:30.356
took the first steps back in the 1970s.

00:03:30.396 --> 00:03:32.156
In 1991,

00:03:32.156 --> 00:03:37.236
we built the first offshore wind farm
in the world called Vindeby.

00:03:37.236 --> 00:03:41.236
Eleven turbines, 54 meters tall.

00:03:41.956 --> 00:03:43.476
That was considered a landmark.

00:03:43.516 --> 00:03:44.876
They were huge.

00:03:44.916 --> 00:03:48.156
Today, of course, they seem pretty tiny.

00:03:48.196 --> 00:03:50.436
This is Kriegers Flak.

00:03:50.436 --> 00:03:53.156
That's the biggest offshore
wind farm in Denmark now.

00:03:53.156 --> 00:03:55.716
72 turbines,

00:03:55.756 --> 00:03:58.236
188 meters tall, each of them.

00:03:59.156 --> 00:04:00.356
To give you a comparison,